cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the original papers below. This repository is an unofficial re-implementation and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to the original authors or their institutions."
title: "Unofficial re-implementation of a hybrid CVAE-CGAN for WAAM defect image augmentation"
type: software
authors:
